# Explainability and Business Thinking

A major lesson from this project was that machine learning systems must provide business value, not only predictions.

Instead of simply predicting churn, RetainIQ Pro explains:

- Why customers are at risk
- Which interventions may reduce churn
- How much revenue could be protected

This changed my perspective on AI systems. Businesses need actionable insights rather than raw probabilities.

The What-If Retention Simulator especially helped me understand how machine learning can support business decision-making.

