# Areas for Improvement

Although the project is strong overall, there are several areas I would improve in future versions.

## Real-Time Monitoring

The current monitoring system is partially simulated. In the future, I would like to connect the monitoring pipeline to a real streaming data source.

---

## Advanced Explainability

The current explanation system uses rule-based and model-based intervention analysis. Future improvements could include:

- SHAP visualizations
- Global feature importance dashboards
- Local explanation charts

---

## CI/CD Integration

The project currently requires manual deployment. Future versions could integrate:

- GitHub Actions
- Automated Docker builds
- Continuous deployment pipelines

---

## Cloud Deployment

Deploying the system to AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud would make the platform more production-realistic.

